@startuml Starting a Write/Read in polling indirect mode for regular memory
== Initialization and configuration ==

== Process polling mode ==
"Application" -> "XSPI" : HAL_XSPI_SendRegularCmd()
note right: Enable write operation
"XSPI" --> "Application" : HAL_OK or HAL_ERROR
"Application" -> "XSPI" : HAL_XSPI_ExecRegularAutoPoll()
note right: Reconfigure XSPI to automatic polling mode to wait for write enabling
"XSPI" --> "Application" : match completed

